{sov: Notes}
Sci-Fi Funk Jam: Debuted as part of the Chilling, Thrilling Sounds of the
Haunted House Halloween set in 2014, built around vintage Disney sound effects.

Heavy Funk Groove: Centered entirely on a driving, single-chord E minor
(Em7 / E Dorian) funk-rock vamp.

Trey's Guitar Motif: Features a fast, syncopated single-note line bouncing
off the open low E string, mixed with aggressive envelope-filter (auto-wah)
stabs on Em9 or Em7 shell voicings.

Trip to Your Savior: The jam space often opens up into wide-open group
improvisation before locking back into the heavy "Your trip is short" vocal
sample cues.
{eov}
